## 安装方式  

### 1. 通过NPM包与CodeBuddy集成  

```json  
{  
  "mcpServers": {  
    "xcode": {  
      "command": "npx",  
      "args": [  
        "-y",  
        "xcode-mcp-server"  
      ],  
      "env": {  
        "PROJECTS_BASE_DIR": "/path/to/your/xcode/projects"  
      }  
    }  
  }  
}  
```  

### 2. 全局NPM安装  
全局安装包:  
```bash  
npm install -g @modelcontextprotocol/xcode-server  
```  

然后更新CodeBuddy配置:  
```json  
{  
  "mcpServers": {  
    "xcode": {  
      "command": "xcode-server",  
      "env": {  
        "PROJECTS_BASE_DIR": "/path/to/your/xcode/projects"  
      }  
    }  
  }  
}  
```  

### 3. 从源码安装  
1. 克隆仓库:  
   ```bash  
   git clone https://github.com/r-huijts/xcode-mcp-server.git  
   cd xcode-mcp-server  
   ```  

2. 安装依赖:  
   ```bash  
   npm install  
   ```  

3. 设置环境变量:  
   ```bash  
   cp .env.example .env  
   ```  
   编辑`.env`文件并设置`PROJECTS_BASE_DIR`为你的Xcode项目目录  

4. 构建项目:  
   ```bash  
   npm run build  
   ```  

然后更新CodeBuddy配置:  
```json  
{  
  "mcpServers": {  
    "xcode": {  
      "command": "node",  
      "args": [  
        "/absolute/path/to/xcode-mcp-server/dist/index.js"  
      ],  
      "env": {  
        "PROJECTS_BASE_DIR": "/path/to/your/xcode/projects"  
      }  
    }  
  }  
}  
```  

> **注意**: 将`/path/to/your/xcode/projects`替换为你实际的Xcode项目目录路径  

更新配置后，重启Claude Desktop使更改生效

